During API reconnaissance, I inspected the following endpoint:

```http
GET /api/activity
```

The response contained an invitation-related activity record.

Relevant response data:

```json
{
  "id": 17,
  "user_id": 3,
  "user_name": "Charlie Brown",
  "action": "invited_user",
