```

### Observations

- User ID 3, identified as Charlie Brown, performed the invitation action.
- The action was `invited_user`.
- The invitation entity ID was 4.
- The intended recipient was `consultant@external.com`.
- The invitation was associated with project UUID `proj-glob-data-plat-002`.
